# Copy to ~/.claude/clock-reminders.conf (or point CLAUDE_CLOCK_REMINDERS_CONF at it).
# Format: name|days|start-end|cwd_glob|message
#   days: ISO weekdays, 1 = Monday; a range (1-5) or list (1,3,5)
#   start-end: local 24-hour HH:MM-HH:MM, start inclusive, end exclusive
#   cwd_glob: shell glob against the session cwd; * matches any
# Each reminder shows once per calendar day.
morning-plan|1-5|08:00-10:00|*|Write down today's priorities before starting.
weekly-review|5|15:00-17:00|*/projects/*|Take a few minutes to review this week's open items.
